actor-demo-slime-mold-name = Slime Mold
actor-demo-slime-mold-description = It's a slime colony. If you so much as dare to touch it.
actor-demo-death-sword-name = Death sword
actor-demo-death-sword-description = A bloodthirsty blade lurking for prey. Beware!
actor-demo-software-bug-name = Software bug
actor-demo-software-bug-description = Oh no! They are everywhere!
actor-demo-lurker-name = Lurker
actor-demo-lurker-description = A strange creature that merges with the dungeon floor, trapping its victims by enveloping them within its perfectly disguised form.
actor-demo-nixie-name = Nixie
actor-demo-nixie-description = A race of fair yet belligerent sea elves.
actor-demo-vlasta-name = Vlasta
actor-demo-vlasta-description = This strange creature looks like a miniature tyrannosaurus. It has empty, pale eyes and a sharp beak, which it aims at your eyes as it jumps at you!
actor-demo-giant-white-dragon-fly-name = Giant white dragon fly
actor-demo-giant-white-dragon-fly-description = It is a large fly that drips frost.
actor-demo-snaga-sapper-name = Snaga sapper
actor-demo-snaga-sapper-description = He is one of the many weaker 'slave' orcs, often mistakenly known as a goblin. He is equipped with an explosive charge.
actor-demo-blue-icky-thing-name = Blue icky thing
actor-demo-blue-icky-thing-description = It is a strange, slimy, icky creature, with rudimentary intelligence, but evil cunning. It hungers for food, and you look tasty.
actor-demo-gibbering-mouther-name = Gibbering mouther
actor-demo-gibbering-mouther-description = A chaotic mass of pulsating flesh, mouths and eyes.
actor-demo-irish-wolfhound-of-flora-name = Irish wolfhound of Flora
actor-demo-irish-wolfhound-of-flora-description = Well-trained watchdogs, obedient to death.
actor-demo-flesh-golem-name = Flesh golem
actor-demo-flesh-golem-description = A shambling humanoid monster with long scars.
actor-demo-cheerful-leprechaun-name = Cheerful leprechaun
actor-demo-cheerful-leprechaun-description = A merry little gnome.
actor-demo-giant-flea-name = Giant flea
actor-demo-giant-flea-description = It makes you itch just to look at it.
actor-demo-ufthak-of-cirith-ungol-name = Ufthak of Cirith Ungol
actor-demo-ufthak-of-cirith-ungol-description = A strong orc guarding the pass of Cirith Ungol. He is mortally afraid of spiders.
actor-demo-orcish-artillery-name = Orcish Artillery
actor-demo-orcish-artillery-description = In a rare display of ingenuity, the Orcs invented an incredibly destructive weapon. Most Orcish artillerists are those who dared criticize its effectiveness.
actor-demo-hibagon-name = Hibagon
actor-demo-hibagon-description = Hibagon.
actor-demo-giant-cockroach-name = Giant cockroach
actor-demo-giant-cockroach-description = Oh no! They are everywhere!
actor-demo-lion-name = Lion
actor-demo-lion-description = A large, frightsome feline, especially dangerous in groups.
actor-demo-snow-leopard-name = Snow leopard
actor-demo-snow-leopard-description = A large, spotted cat, at home in the cold, snowy mountains.
actor-demo-hippogriff-name = Hippogriff
actor-demo-hippogriff-description = A strange hybrid of eagle, lion and horse. It looks weird.
actor-demo-illusionist-name = Illusionist
actor-demo-illusionist-description = A deceptive spell caster.
actor-demo-black-ogre-name = Black ogre
actor-demo-black-ogre-description = A massive orc-like figure with black skin and powerful arms.
actor-demo-half-orc-name = Half-orc
actor-demo-half-orc-description = He is a hideous deformed cross-breed with man and orc, combining man's strength and cunning with orcish evil.
actor-demo-giant-octopus-name = Giant octopus
actor-demo-giant-octopus-description = It doesn't move very fast, but when it does - watch out!
actor-demo-guardian-naga-name = Guardian naga
actor-demo-guardian-naga-description = A giant snake-like figure with a woman's torso.
actor-demo-light-hound-name = Light hound
actor-demo-light-hound-description = A brilliant canine form whose light hurts your eyes, even at this distance.
actor-demo-shadow-hound-name = Shadow hound
actor-demo-shadow-hound-description = A hole in the air in the shape of a huge hound. No light falls upon its form.
actor-demo-flying-skull-name = Flying skull
actor-demo-flying-skull-description = A skullpack animated by necromantic spells.
actor-demo-giant-tarantula-name = Giant tarantula
actor-demo-giant-tarantula-description = A giant spider with hairy black and red legs.
actor-demo-giant-clear-centipede-name = Giant clear centipede
actor-demo-giant-clear-centipede-description = It is about four feet long and carnivorous.
actor-demo-mirkwood-spider-name = Mirkwood spider
actor-demo-mirkwood-spider-description = A strong and powerful spider from Mirkwood forest. Cunning and evil, it seeks to taste your juicy insides.
actor-demo-homonculus-name = Homonculus
actor-demo-homonculus-description = It is a small demonic spirit full of malevolence.
actor-demo-clear-hound-name = Clear hound
actor-demo-clear-hound-description = A completely translucent hound.
actor-demo-carrion-name = Carrion
actor-demo-carrion-description = A mummified, undead great avian creature, who now serves as a steed for mighty undead creatures.
actor-demo-unstable-worm-mass-name = Unstable worm mass
actor-demo-unstable-worm-mass-description = A seething mass of thick, glowing worms.
actor-demo-the-ghost-q-name = The Ghost 'Q'
actor-demo-the-ghost-q-description = He has only three hair. He is careless, but kind, and always a bit hungry.
actor-demo-mad-bear-name = Mad bear
actor-demo-mad-bear-description = These bears are followers of Red Helm.
actor-demo-trench-wurm-name = Trench Wurm
actor-demo-trench-wurm-description = Their arrival marks the end of Yawgmoth's subtlety.
actor-demo-time-initiate-name = Time Initiate
actor-demo-time-initiate-description = A human, clothed in a blue robe, moving with speed uncanny.
actor-demo-dimetrodon-name = Dimetrodon
actor-demo-dimetrodon-description = This ridiculous looking creature has a large sail-like fin extending down its back.
actor-demo-duck-quacked-platypus-name = Duck-quacked platypus
actor-demo-duck-quacked-platypus-description = An exceedingly strange, vaguely mammalian being, created by some inexperienced maintainer who had yet to grasp the principles of monster design.
actor-demo-giant-yellow-toad-name = Giant yellow toad
actor-demo-giant-yellow-toad-description = The skin of this large toad glistens with poison. You feel sick just looking at it.
ability-legacy-mind-blast-7d7-name = Mind Blast
ability-legacy-mind-blast-7d7-description = Deals 7d7 psi damage and attempts to confuse the target for 80 ticks.
actor-demo-dweller-on-the-threshold-name = Dweller on the threshold
actor-demo-dweller-on-the-threshold-description = A huge purple Buddha-shaped creature covered with teeth. It picks them with the bones of conjurers.
actor-demo-dark-naga-name = Dark naga
actor-demo-dark-naga-description = A giant snake-like creature with a woman's torso. It is less powerful than other nagas, but more gifted with magic.
actor-demo-wererat-name = Wererat
actor-demo-wererat-description = A huge rat with glowing red eyes. This revolting creature revels in filth and disease.
actor-demo-mi-go-name = Mi-Go
actor-demo-mi-go-description = A pink, five-foot crustacean body bears vast fins, membranous wings and many jointed limbs; short tentacles cover the ellipsoid where its head should be.
actor-demo-griffon-name = Griffon
actor-demo-griffon-description = Half lion and half eagle, it flies toward you with menacing force.
actor-demo-floating-orb-name = Floating orb
actor-demo-floating-orb-description = A metal sphere floats in the air, spinning as it tracks you with hostile intent.
actor-demo-undead-devilfish-name = Undead devilfish
actor-demo-undead-devilfish-description = A devilfish returned from the dead.
actor-demo-radiant-kavu-name = Radiant Kavu
actor-demo-radiant-kavu-description = When angered or startled, it shields itself with a blinding flash.
ability-legacy-bolt-acid-7d8-5-name = Acid bolt
ability-legacy-bolt-acid-7d8-5-description = Fires a bolt for 7d8+5 acid damage.
ability-legacy-summon-legacy-import-l15-1d1-name = Summon monster
ability-legacy-summon-legacy-import-l15-1d1-description = Summons one monster of level 15 or lower.
ability-legacy-drain-mana-8-name = Drain Mana
ability-legacy-drain-mana-8-description = Drains 8 mana from the target.
ability-legacy-bolt-cold-6d8-5-name = Cold bolt
ability-legacy-bolt-cold-6d8-5-description = Fires a bolt for 6d8+5 cold damage.
ability-legacy-heal-45-name = Heal self
ability-legacy-heal-45-description = Restores 45 hit points.
ability-legacy-kin-wererat-name = Summon kin
ability-legacy-kin-wererat-description = Summons two wererats nearby.
ability-legacy-summon-demon-l15-1d3-1-name = Summon demons
ability-legacy-summon-demon-l15-1d3-1-description = Summons 1d3+1 demons of level 15 or lower.
ability-legacy-bolt-physical-4d5-name = Shoot
ability-legacy-bolt-physical-4d5-description = Launches a projectile for 4d5 physical damage.
ability-legacy-bolt-physical-2d6-5-name = Magic missile
ability-legacy-bolt-physical-2d6-5-description = Fires a magic missile for 2d6+5 physical damage.
ability-legacy-breath-nether-14-550-r2-name = Breathe nether
ability-legacy-breath-nether-14-550-r2-description = Breathes a radius-2 cone of nether for 14% of current HP, capped at 550 damage.
ability-legacy-breath-nexus-33-250-r2-name = Breathe nexus
ability-legacy-breath-nexus-33-250-r2-description = Breathes a radius-2 cone of nexus for 33% of current HP, capped at 250 damage.
actor-demo-plaguebearer-of-nurgle-name = Plaguebearer of Nurgle
actor-demo-plaguebearer-of-nurgle-description = An incurable plague killed this victim and raised it as a rotting demonic zombie with one eye and a pale horn.
actor-demo-gnome-mage-name = Gnome mage
actor-demo-gnome-mage-description = A small mage.
ability-legacy-summon-ant-l15-1d3-1-name = Summon ants
ability-legacy-summon-ant-l15-1d3-1-description = Summons 1d3+1 ants of level 15 or lower.
ability-legacy-blink-other-name = Blink target
ability-legacy-blink-other-description = Blinks the target to a random open position within ten tiles.
actor-demo-buzzy-beetle-name = Buzzy beetle
actor-demo-buzzy-beetle-description = A heavily armored beetle whose shell turns incoming bolts aside.
